// Stage E1 (f_tf_hatch): eigen decode + commit + guard. in1 = the TENSOR
// (f_tf_tensormap outlet 0, raw float32; f_tensor_type.md encoding).
// Mirrors tests/test_tf_hatch.py stage_e1. Intermediate texture, NEVER an
// outlet; unbounded float32 (plan ADR-4 -- no clamp, no 0.5-offset here).
//
// out1 = (ca, sa, commit, pres):
//   (ca, sa)     cos/sin of the commit-frame axis:
//                axis = theta + pi/2 + angle_offset*pi/2
//   commit       SHAPE only: the commit curve (smoothstep in the normalized
//                eigengap; 0 = dot, 1 = stroke; PROVISIONAL knees C_LO/C_HI --
//                OQ3 open, tier-3 confirms). Never multiplies brightness.
//   pres         PRESENCE only: 0 = draw nothing, 1 = draw. A smooth ramp on
//                the tensormap-encoded trace (R + B = trace * the tensormap's
//                strength) against structure_floor^2; 0 where the eps_trace
//                guard fires (direction-undefined/zero tensor, tensormap
//                ADR-6/T019 value cited): axis UNSET (ca=sa=0), commit 0 --
//                never an atan2 artifact (plan ADR-5). (This channel was
//                `iso`, a 0/1 guard flag; made continuous 2026-10-28.)
//
// SHAPE vs PRESENCE (2026-10-28, first live look): commit used to scale both
// the mark aspect AND its brightness, so the line->dot rounding faded to
// black and the coherence gate only dimmed the field. Now commit sets shape
// alone and pres sets whether a mark is drawn at all.
//
// DECODE IDIOM: copied VERBATIM from .specify/f_tf_glyph/plan.md ADR-2
// (the canonical block; do not re-derive):
//   in: t = sample(tensor_tex, clamp(cell_uv_to_texel))  // tensormap ADR-5 clamp
//   encoding: f_tensor_type.md outlet 0 - R>=0 G:0.5=zero B>=0 A=1 (all x strength)
//   Jxx = t.r / strength; Jxy = (t.g - 0.5)*2.0/strength; Jyy = t.b/strength;
//   trace = Jxx + Jyy; diff = Jxx - Jyy; root = sqrt(diff*diff + 4.0*Jxy*Jxy);
//   lambda1 = 0.5*(trace + root); lambda2 = 0.5*(trace - root);
//   theta = 0.5*atan2(2.0*Jxy, diff);      // GRADIENT axis; along = theta + pi/2
//   ... 0.5*atan2 confines theta to (-pi/2, pi/2]; safe ONLY for consumers
//   symmetric to theta+180 deg (hatch IS: an unoriented line pattern).
// Coherence normalization is TENSormap's (its plan ADR-2, not glyph's):
//   coherence = (lambda1-lambda2)/(lambda1+lambda2) -- gain-free.
// Sample coordinate: the read is AT norm (texel centered, always in-bounds);
// the clamp is kept for the in-shader rule (tensormap T012 finding).
//
// NOTE: this stage reads strength and angle_offset; commit knees C_LO/C_HI
// are constants here (OQ3 provisional) -- coherence_gate rides C_LO.

Param strength(100.0);
Param angle_offset(0.0);
Param coherence_gate(0.25);
Param structure_floor(0.1);

eps_trace = 0.000001;
C_HI = 1.0;    // commit saturates at coherence 1 (C_LO is coherence_gate, a live Param above)

uv = vec(clamp(norm.x, 0.0, 1.0), clamp(norm.y, 0.0, 1.0));
t = sample(in1, uv);

// --- decode (glyph ADR-2 verbatim) ---
jxx = t.r / strength;
jxy = (t.g - 0.5) * 2.0 / strength;
jyy = t.b / strength;
trace = jxx + jyy;
diff = jxx - jyy;
root = sqrt(diff*diff + 4.0*jxy*jxy);
theta = 0.5 * atan2(2.0*jxy, diff);   // gradient axis (across the edge)

iso = 1.0 - step(eps_trace, trace);   // 1 = zero/undefined tensor
// the -1-Jxy artifact of an all-zeros read (f_tensor_type.md rule 5) also
// has trace 0: the SAME guard catches it (root 2/strength, phantom axis --
// never written: ca/sa stay (0, 0) below).

// coherence, gain-free (tensormap plan ADR-2):
coh = clamp(root / max(trace, eps_trace), 0.0, 1.0);

// commit curve (PROVISIONAL smoothstep in the normalized eigengap, OQ3):
// coherence_gate is the performer's commit floor: coherence at/below it
// renders nothing (spec: the gate rides the knee, not a separate AND-mask,
// so crossing the floor is continuous -- the no-seam guarantee).
x = (coh - max(coherence_gate, 0.0)) / max(C_HI - max(coherence_gate, 0.0), 0.000001);
x = clamp(x, 0.0, 1.0);
commit = x*x*(3.0 - 2.0*x) * (1.0 - iso);

// commit-frame axis: along-structure + the performer rotation. The axis is
// an UNORIENTED line (theta+180 is the same line): the offset wraps cleanly
// (mod pi), the acceptance criterion's no-seam property.
eff = theta + halfpi + angle_offset * halfpi * 2.0 * 0.5;  // = +offset*pi/2
ca = cos(eff) * (1.0 - iso);
sa = sin(eff) * (1.0 - iso);

// presence (2026-10-28): is there structure here AT ALL, regardless of its
// direction. enc_trace = R + B = trace * the producing tensormap's strength
// (its calibrated scale, ~1 on strong structure), so structure_floor reads
// on the same scale as tensormap's trace output. thr = floor^2 (finer at the
// low end); ramp 0.5*thr -> 1.5*thr (+ a hair, so floor 0 is a step at the
// iso guard: presence 1 wherever any structure exists). Not strength-
// invariant for floor > 0 -- the one absolute quantity in the module.
enc_trace = t.r + t.b;
thr = structure_floor * structure_floor;
pres = smoothstep(0.5 * thr, 1.5 * thr + 0.000001, enc_trace) * (1.0 - iso);

out1 = vec(ca, sa, commit, pres);